{"sourceUrl":"https://me.ustb.edu.cn/tzgg/5ac4d19ac1e040328cace854bc2ba795.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:31.622866+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://me.ustb.edu.cn/tzgg/5ac4d19ac1e040328cace854bc2ba795.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>院长寄语</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>亲爱的同学们：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>北京科技大学机械工程学院的历史可追溯至</span><span>1952年建校初期的钢铁机械系，七十余载风雨砥砺，一代代机械人在满井村这片热土接力奋进。中国工程院院士、中国深海载人潜水器“蛟龙<span>”</span>号总指挥、“天问一号”火星探测器总指挥、中国载人航天工程专家，政界精英、企业领袖等一批国家栋梁和优秀人才从这里走出。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院现有</span><span>“机械工程”、“物流工程”、“设计学”学术型学位授权点，“机械”、“工程管理”专业学位授权点，研究领域涉及智能制造、机器人、航空航天装备、新能源汽车、智慧物流、交互设计等众多新兴领域。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院师资力量雄厚，名师荟萃，拥有包括中国工程院院士、英国皇家工程院院士、国家重大人才工程入选者、教育部重大人才计划入选者、教育部</span><span>“新世纪优秀人才支持计划”获得者、北京市教学名师等知名学者在内的高水平师资队伍和久负盛名的国家级教学团队。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>真诚期待并欢迎你们加入机械工程学院大家庭！这里将是同学们美好人生和辉煌事业的新起点！</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品行良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>有望取得就读高校推荐免试资格的应届毕业生，硕士推免生入学前应取得国家承认的本科学历证书，直博生入学前应取得国家承认的本科学历证书和学士学位证书，否则录取资格无效。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span><span>英语水平良好。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4. </span><span><span>对拟申报的学科（专业）具有浓厚兴趣，具备攻读硕士研究生的基本能力和素质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5．身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6. </span><span><span>申请本科直博者，除满足以上条件外，还应具有较强的科研创新能力和博士生培养潜力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>接收</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>推免生的类型与</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span></span></strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"ScreenShot_2026-09-08_175018_603.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://me.ustb.edu.cn/images/2026-09/5fc8d7cf8000402bb7259171d8bef2a0.png\"/></p>\n<p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>报名时间：即日起至</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>24：00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>. </span><span><span>报名方式：凡有意向申请者，包括本校生源在内，均须通过我校研究生招生管理</span></span><span><span>信息系统</span></span><span><span>申请报名。申请者可点击</span></span><span><span>以下链接</span></span><span><span>进入报名系统：</span></span><a href=\"http://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt</span></a><span><span>，招生项目选择</span><span>“</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免生预报名”（建议使用谷歌浏览器）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span><span>材料准备与提交</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span><span>1）硕士研究生申请者</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>①身份证及学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②所在学院或学校教务部门盖章的本科1</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>6学期成绩单1份</span></span><span><span>，成绩排名</span></span><span><span>1份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③体现英语水平的证明材料(大学英语四、六级成绩，雅思成绩，TOEFL成绩， GRE/GMAT成绩等)；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>④</span></span><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span><span>分钟个人</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>自述</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>PPT电子版，主要</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>包括以下</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>内容</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>a.</span></strong><strong><span><span>个人基本情况</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>；</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>b.</span></strong><strong><span><span>专业知识学习情况；</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>c.实习实践经历；</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>d.</span></strong><strong><span><span>学科竞赛获奖、科研成果、作品展示等</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>⑤</span></span><span><span>其他证明材料，包括论文或专利等学术成果，各类竞赛获奖</span></span><span><span>、荣誉称号</span></span><span><span>等证书，及其他可体现个人素质和能力的材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请在截止日期前完成报名，并按照系统提示填写个人信息并上传以上所有材料，过期不再接受申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span><span>2）博士研究生申请者</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>①上述（1）中所列材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②《攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》2份，须2名教授或相当职称以上的专家分别推荐，推荐书手书机打均可，但推荐人签名必须手书，下载链接：</span></span><span>https://yzxc.ustb.edu.cn/cyxz/263329c27a1845eea6e8ca785153521f.htm</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>材料审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日报名截止后组织专家对考生申报材料进行评议，确定申请考生的复试入围资格，申请人届时在我校研究生招生管理</span></span><span><span>信息系统</span></span><span><span>查询审核结果。如材料不符合要求将退回修改，请在学院规定的时间内重新上传（登录系统查看），逾期视为自愿放弃。同时学院将在我校研究生招生管理信息系统发送进入复试通知，收到通知即获得预复试资格，申请者应在规定时间内及时在系统里缴纳</span><span>1</span></span><span>00</span><span><span>元复试费并确认参加复试，复试费一旦缴纳，不予退还；未在规定时间内缴费并确认参加复试的，视为自愿放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试具体安排将另行通知。请各位申请者关注学院官网。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>其他注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>获得推免拟录取资格的同学，务必按照教育部及学院要求在规定时间内（</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>下旬</span></span><span><span>）登录中国研招网</span><span>“推免服务系统”（网址：</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）填报志愿，网上完成接收并确认学院的复试及待录取通知等环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：北京市</span></span><span><span>海淀区学院路</span></span><span><span>30号北京科技大学机械工程学院（机电楼10</span></span><span>09</span><span><span>室）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：甘</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span><span><span>，</span><span>010-62332419</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱</span></span><span><span>：</span><span>yjsoffice</span></span><a href=\"mailto:jxyjs@ustb.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>@ustb.edu.cn</span></span></a><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>网</span></span><span><span>址</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><a href=\"http://me.ustb.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://me.ustb.edu.cn/</span></a><span> </span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>7</span><span>年机械</span></span><span><span>学院招生</span></span><span><span>QQ</span><span>群</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><strong><span><span>进群申请请注明姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科院校</span><span>+</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免</span><span>3</span><span>群</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>980356025    </span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>监督投诉</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院党委办公室：朱老师，机电楼</span><span>1008</span><span>，</span><span>010-62332366</span><span>，</span></span><a href=\"mailto:dwoffice@ustb.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>dwoffice@ustb.edu.cn</span></a><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>北京科技大学</span> <span>机械工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>6</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"f72847d6c37338ad50dc1b380f0f2d29d7f7a10400cd485853060c55dfe9c23d","textLength":1863,"sourceSha256":"f1c4c0c279373c7afd167e5e9f3e9f36af687d7b1792b785e50f5c5db4787bc4","selector":"article-like:gp-article1 gp-article gp-f16 gp-pb-20","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dd17fdef42b1acd5957a","title":"2026年北京科技大学机械工程学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名（第二批）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:31.622866+00:00"}
